tn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144420/extras/47e8abf2ea48535161d89be82922447a.avif?t=1678550054\" /></div><br><br>Quiz Section consists of questions related to the learning contents.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144420/extras/0ce59ef62787748bec10f165b16be8b8.avif?t=1678550054\" /></div><br><br>The overall scores and points will be displayed on the scoreboard once you have completed answering the quizzes. Hit Retry to repeat the questions.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144420/extras/7cec4ae907d133545553b9218a46579d.avif?t=1678550054\" /></div><br><br>Manual is provided for reference. (See: View the manual).",
